The Point is one of Lake Cumberland's most recent hospitality assets.  While many regional parks struggle with aging infrastructure and limited power, The Point offers a "Permanent Home Base" built for  the next generation of travelers.  By acquiring the core 18-core footprint, the new owner secures a turnkey operation with high-efficiency utility pass-throughs and immeal flow.  This could be a stable, high-margin asset in the heart of the Lake Cumberland tourism corridor. Additional expansion acreage available including owners estate totaling nearly 100 acres.

Make The Point your peaceful home base near the Lake.

Leave the hustle behind.  Come and relax on our quiet 100- acre farm, with fishing ponds, full hookups and a community that treats you like a friend.

